printing.limit = Inprimɛli baara bɛ danw tɛmɛ: ja 200, pikisɛli miliyɔn 40 ja kelen-kelen na, walima pikisɛli 32768 ja kelen-kelen kɛrɛ kelen-kelen na, walima PDF kunnafoni min digi len don 256 MiB.
printing.profile_error = Nin ja kulɛri porofili tɛ tiɲɛ ye, a tɛ bɛn ja ma, walima a tɛ se ka kɛ. Ni sɛbɛn bɔyɔrɔla kulɛri kanalw ye CMYK/Lab ye, porofili tiɲɛ min donnen don a kɔnɔ ka kan ka kɛ; RGB bɛ RGB porofili ɲini.
printing.does_not_fit = Ja tɛ nin sigida kɔnɔ a ka sɛbɛn DPI kan. Fit cogo kɛ, grid siraw ni koloniw hakɛ dɔgɔya, walima waraka min ka bonya ka bon kɛ.
printing.caption_limit = Foto kanfɔli ka jan nin grid kama. Siraw walima koloniw hakɛ dɔgɔya, kanfɔli surunya, walima kanfɔliw dabila.
printing.font_error = Fɔnti si tɛ foto kanfɔli kama. Sɛbɛnni fɔnti sigindi walima kanfɔliw dabila.
printing.no_document = Sɛbɛn dayɛlɛ walima galeri fotow sugandi sani i ka inprimɛ.
printing.source_error = Foto sugandilen, a labɛnniw ka dosiyɛ min bɛ a dafɛ, walima foto kanfɔli ma se ka kalan. PDF si ma mara.
printing.save_error = A ma se ka PDF mara. Filen tɔgɔ kura sugandi fɔldɛri kɔnɔ min na a bɛ se ka sɛbɛn; dosiyɛ minw bɛ yen kɔrɔlen tɛ yɛlɛma abada.
printing.downloaded = PDF telesarizera. A dayɛlɛ PDF lajɛlan kɔnɔ k'a inprimɛ 100% kan.
